(o)
"premises" means any place, land, yard, building or any other site that is used for semen production, processing,
storage, transport, distribution, trade or utilization;
(p)
"prescribed" means prescribed by rules made under this Act;
(q)
"recognised laboratory" means the National, Regional, State level disease diagnostic laboratory or any private and
national level laboratory duly authorised by the Authority;
(r)
"Registrar" means the Registrar of the Authority;
(s)
"semen" means the semen or sexed semen of cow-bull or buffalo-bull in any form;
(t)
"semen bank" means premises where the bovine semen is stored for trading or distribution;
